code: 0
--- stdout
задача не нужна или дубль

  From:      any status
  To:        the status is not changed
  Requires:  --comment
  Confirm:   the user's decision: ask the user first; runs only with --yes
  Board:     adds the issue if it is not there
  Close:     closes the issue as not planned; an issue already closed stays as it is
  Comment:   posted unless it renders empty or is already the latest gh-dojo comment:
               {comment}

Usage:
  gh dojo drop <N> [flags]

Flags:
      --comment string   text for {comment} in the comment
      --dry-run          print the plan without changing anything
  -h, --help             help for drop
      --show             also print the issue's card, as gh dojo show N does, from the same read
      --yes              the user agreed: run a verb that is the user's decision

Global Flags:
  -q, --jq expression       filter the JSON with a jq expression (implies --json)
      --json                print the result as JSON (schema_version 1), errors too
  -t, --template template   format the JSON with a Go template (implies --json)
--- stderr
